				"# <span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-weight: bold; font-size: 40px; color: #FFAB3B;\">🚀惡棍BorgesAI知识库</span>\n\n## <span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-weight: bold; font-size: 26px; color: FFFFFF;\">➡️最牛逼的ComfyUI x WebUI的图文教程<br>➡️各行业模型及工作流下载<br>➡️AI影像前沿资讯<br>➡️Midjourney官方教程<br>➡️提示词、风格、美学网站资源<br>➡️GPT x DeepSeek提示词工程<br>✨✨✨<br><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-weight: bold; font-size: 26px; color: FFFFFF;\">知识库链接：\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-weight: bold; font-size: 26px; color: FFFFFF;\">[https://cin29q9h9n.feishu.cn/wiki/KzSywRG5ji1HCRkOirBcdUfWnWo?from=from_copylink](https://cin29q9h9n.feishu.cn/wiki/KzSywRG5ji1HCRkOirBcdUfWnWo?from=from_copylink)\n\n## <span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-weight: bold; font-size: 26px; color: FFFFFF;\"><br>🙋模型训练 x 工作流定制 x 疑难解答 ➡️ 联系微信：<a href=\"https://huggingface.co/manking/borges/blob/main/wechat.png\">black_pear</a></span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-weight: bold; font-size: 26px; color: FFFFFF;\"><br>🔗个人网站：\n[https://cin29q9h9n.feishu.cn/wiki/OlCXwuG2YiAJitkIEJ7cFeiNnSh?from=from_copylink](https://cin29q9h9n.feishu.cn/wiki/OlCXwuG2YiAJitkIEJ7cFeiNnSh?from=from_copylink)\n<br>\n\n\n## <span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-weight: bold; font-size: 26px; color: FFFFFF;\"><br>✈️ComfyUI快速入门：\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-weight: bold; font-size: 26px; color: FFFFFF;\">[https://space.bilibili.com/402195818](https://space.bilibili.com/402195818)\n</span></span></span></span></span></span>",
